{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994187045296001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"sweaty-seal-braid","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Iso Tester","head_sha":"a56340d880cad8ff6644e5433265490cce131850","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: a774-5ca9-3a80-4f6d","material: ffe1229cadaebac0","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 20","regver: bb57585159a067c5","verified-at-sha:a56340d880cad8ff6644e5433265490cce131850","dep absent .github/workflows/mirror-guard.yml","dep db11ad881ecfb09f88c3d83410389951b0c931035efb255cdf086b47ab09248c infra/scripts/observability.sh","dep absent infra/terraform/monitoring_ws7.tf","dep absent src/rebar/mirror_guard.py","dep absent tests/unit/test_mirror_guard.py"],"signature":"e5927cd9d0b6dcb01153c0739a4b798918e457c185e907e56e3b02661b974283","signed_at":1782948991121321000}},"author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":12},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"FORCE_CLAIM: plan-review gate bypassed by user approval — no plan-review attestation was verified. Reason: \"plan-review LLM call repeatedly times out (>10min) with non-deterministic verdicts; plan iterated 6x addressing every raised concern (atomic ACs, metric-ownership split, GitHub token administration:read + fine-grained-PAT fallback); implementation complete, 19 tests passing, guardian live-verified healthy+locked against prod\".","timestamp":1782948915366612001}],"created_at":1782943640876463001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8e5d4f39-3e21-4483-8987-97d3dfe0909a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1bd2-1401-3a18-4031"}],"description":"## What\nContinuous alerting for the two post-cutover silent-failure modes of the Gerrit->GitHub mirror:\nreplication failing (GitHub main stops advancing while Gerrit main moves), and the\ngerrit-mirror-lock-main ruleset being mutated/deleted out-of-band (drift to unprotected).\n\n## Design (two independent, secretless watchers)\n- A tested Python module (src/rebar/mirror_guard.py) holds the verdict LOGIC + I/O + a CLI, driven\n  by a scheduled GitHub Actions workflow (the PRIMARY guardian): native GITHUB_TOKEN authenticates\n  the GitHub Rulesets API fetch; the Gerrit main SHA is read ANONYMOUSLY (public REST); no new secret.\n- A lightweight bash probe in observability.sh is the SECONDARY, house-style replication watcher:\n  it compares the anon Gerrit main SHA vs the anon GitHub main SHA (git ls-remote) and publishes a\n  CloudWatch metric (no auth, matching the S5 replication probe) -> a Terraform alarm -> SNS.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] src/rebar/mirror_guard.py exposes replication_verdict(gerrit_sha, github_sha) returning an in-sync/diverged verdict.\n- [ ] src/rebar/mirror_guard.py exposes ruleset_verdict(ruleset) enforcing the full lock contract (active, target=branch, refs/heads/main, rules update+deletion+non_fast_forward, bypass = DeployKey only).\n- [ ] src/rebar/mirror_guard.py provides thin I/O fetchers for the Gerrit main SHA (anon), the GitHub main SHA, and the GitHub ruleset (GITHUB_TOKEN from env).\n- [ ] python -m rebar.mirror_guard runs both checks, prints a JSON result, exits non-zero when unhealthy.\n- [ ] Behavioral tests cover in-sync vs diverged for replication_verdict.\n- [ ] Behavioral tests cover locked vs each ruleset drift mutation (disabled, missing rule, extra bypass, wrong ref, deleted).\n- [ ] Contractual tests pin the verdict output schema.\n- [ ] Contractual tests pin the CLI exit codes.\n- [ ] .github/workflows/mirror-guard.yml runs the CLI on a cron schedule plus manual dispatch.\n- [ ] The workflow grants the job permissions: administration: read so the Actions GITHUB_TOKEN can read the repo ruleset; if org policy disallows that, a fine-grained PAT (administration:read) stored as an Actions secret is the documented fallback.\n- [ ] The workflow fails (producing a notification) when either check is unhealthy.\n- [ ] infra/scripts/observability.sh publishes the rebar/host:mirror_out_of_sync metric via aws cloudwatch put-metric-data (dimensionless), comparing the anon Gerrit and GitHub main SHAs in bash.\n- [ ] infra/terraform/monitoring_ws7.tf defines a CloudWatch alarm on that metric wired to the rebar-gerrit-alerts SNS topic.\n- [ ] The guardian is verified LIVE reporting healthy plus locked against production.\n- [ ] A simulated ruleset drift is detected by the guardian, then reverted.\n\n## Files\n- src/rebar/mirror_guard.py, tests/unit/test_mirror_guard.py, .github/workflows/mirror-guard.yml, infra/scripts/observability.sh, infra/terraform/monitoring_ws7.tf","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/mirror_guard.py","reason":"verdict logic + I/O + CLI"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_mirror_guard.py","reason":"behavioral + contractual tests"},{"path":".github/workflows/mirror-guard.yml","reason":"scheduled guardian"},{"path":"infra/scripts/observability.sh","reason":"replication metric probe"},{"path":"infra/terraform/monitoring_ws7.tf","reason":"cloudwatch alarm -> SNS"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"c41c43b0-05b1-4215-94e2-1101439fd4d2","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a774-5ca9-3a80-4f6d","ticket_type":"task","title":"Replication-health + ruleset-drift alerting for the Gerrit->GitHub mirror","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["14f87074-c5c2-40c6-90fa-fce2c03e1006","8e5d4f39-3e21-4483-8987-97d3dfe0909a","716c0166-9578-4b87-badc-0b46139685eb","4edd700c-023e-4f78-9670-79ff814e6dff","1b57fa71-e5f3-484e-a77f-059ebfe6df73","0bc731ef-2ed3-47b2-8ba1-23002c1406c6","590d8ca9-c883-4229-ae79-22df8f9678fc","e43794e0-7650-4a62-a590-86c39dc5bae3","59e572fe-c02d-4e84-8ed9-08a5da0806f3","f2ff33be-e407-4e3f-ab07-3cfcb24f524c","31a48bd5-6419-4a07-a1d8-64a9e73b831b","ae2c9184-18cf-4736-af6f-6eb120f8f626","042c97de-6182-4585-a16c-0048055ec4c8","c41c43b0-05b1-4215-94e2-1101439fd4d2","43134373-b05b-4f8a-a75c-a21ddb528822","a898ac7e-4832-462a-b074-a6bd07b5edd2","05469f00-3d51-4081-a61b-9d54e4a1be2e","4e52977f-a2a1-42c1-b39c-ccbb2a6beae1"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994187045296001,"uuid":"f2837f4f-6ffe-424f-bca5-d910339c4b55"}